# Default-deny: publish code, not local notes, assets, or generated files.
*
!*/

# C, C++, C#, and assembly source.
!*.c
!*.h
!*.cc
!*.cpp
!*.cxx
!*.c++
!*.hh
!*.hpp
!*.hxx
!*.h++
!*.inl
!*.ipp
!*.tpp
!*.ixx
!*.cppm
!*.cs
!*.csx
!*.asm
!*.s
!*.S
!*.inc

# Build definitions and the policy needed to enforce this allowlist.
!*.csproj
!CMakeLists.txt
!*.cmake
!*.cmake.in
!/.gitignore

# Never publish generated/vendor source from local build and tool folders.
.git/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.cache/
out/
build/
build-*/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeFiles/
_deps/
Testing/
test-results/
coverage/
coverage-*/
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/

# Private reference folders stay local, even if they contain code examples.
/docs/
/handoffs/
/sources/
/assets/
/licenses/
